    "md": "• Plant Maintenance ► Maintenance Processing ► Shift Note and Shift Report ► Shift Notes ► Define Shift Note Types\n• Plant Maintenance ► Maintenance Processing ► Shift Note and Shift Report ► Shift Reports ► Define Shift Report Types\n• Plant Maintenance ► Maintenance Processing ► Shift Note and Shift Report ► Define Shift Definitions and Sequences"
